{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01267",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 2.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "good afternoon, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.04,
      "end_seconds": 7.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.25,
      "end_seconds": 20.4,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "doctor it's a sore ankle it's getting on my nerves now a neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.43,
      "end_seconds": 25.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.46,
      "end_seconds": 30.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "It's been six months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.87,
      "end_seconds": 36.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.93,
      "end_seconds": 43.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "pretty moderate, if I'm being honest it's worse with walking"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.17,
      "end_seconds": 47.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.53,
      "end_seconds": 66.78,
      "duration_seconds": 18.25,
      "text": "A little swelling goes along with it, most of the time. The little swelling? That's been for about a week. Sorry, uh, what was I saying, as for little swelling, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.34,
      "end_seconds": 71.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.77,
      "end_seconds": 79.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "I've had high cholesterol for about a year now. I've got thin bones"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.24,
      "end_seconds": 89.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "understood alright, high cholesterol, that matches what I have here has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.62,
      "end_seconds": 94.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Diclofenac. I come out in... well wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.12,
      "end_seconds": 102.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.43,
      "end_seconds": 107.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "right my daughter has type 1 diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.57,
      "end_seconds": 110.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "let's run through your medicines"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.5,
      "end_seconds": 136.53,
      "duration_seconds": 24.03,
      "text": "hmm, I'm on rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night. I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week. Ibuprofen gel, three times a day. I'm not great at remembering details, so so bear with me. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.06,
      "end_seconds": 151.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Alright, do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.73,
      "end_seconds": 161.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.8,
      "end_seconds": 167.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "what does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.0,
      "end_seconds": 173.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.89,
      "end_seconds": 178.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "any numbness, crack or pop or pain in the foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.57,
      "end_seconds": 185.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "sorry uh what was I saying no not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.11,
      "end_seconds": 195.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "What about your tummy and and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.1,
      "end_seconds": 200.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "no, that that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.09,
      "end_seconds": 205.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "on the the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.67,
      "end_seconds": 208.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.51,
      "end_seconds": 226.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.57,
      "end_seconds": 236.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.92,
      "end_seconds": 266.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 16, blood pressure 121 over 71, oxygen saturation is 98 percent and pulse is 70 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.82,
      "end_seconds": 273.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.77,
      "end_seconds": 278.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.33,
      "end_seconds": 281.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.31,
      "end_seconds": 305.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "There's mild swelling over the outside of the ankle, and you can put your weight on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.92,
      "end_seconds": 312.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Right, please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.89,
      "end_seconds": 359.5,
      "duration_seconds": 34.61,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? My working impression is a mild ankle sprain. Rest ice a compression bandage and keep it raised for two days. Cut back on tea coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Come back or go to emergency straight away if you cannot put weight on it. Please come and see me if it is not better in two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.28,
      "end_seconds": 364.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "yeah, you know, alright, I'll be back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.65,
      "end_seconds": 369.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 370.45,
      "end_seconds": 372.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "thank you that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.15,
      "end_seconds": 375.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
}